   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2443_3455341890"/>5.2 SoundFonts<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2443_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">choz synthesises SF2 with its own engine, with no dependency on FluidSynth. Loaded, the tab shows the preset on the <text:span text:style-name="T2">BANK</text:span> row and the engine&apos;s knob box: the bank&apos;s reverb and chorus sends, the envelope (Attack, Hold, Decay, Sustain, Release), the filter (Cutoff, Reso), tuning (Coarse, Fine) and output (Pan, Volume).</text:p>
