   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap">Figure 5.4 — An SF2 bank browser: the 128 programs of bank 0 and the file&apos;s other banks.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2449_3455341890"/>5.5 Parameters, pages and search<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2449_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">p</text:span> opens the parameter list with exact values; <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">l</text:span> on a row learns a CC for it. A plugin with hundreds of parameters is shown two rows at a time — <text:span text:style-name="T2">PgUp</text:span> and <text:span text:style-name="T2">PgDn</text:span> turn the page, and learned CCs move with the box, so eight faders reach every parameter the plugin has. <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">/</text:span> searches a knob by name and jumps to the page holding it.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Imagen11" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="15.499cm" svg:height="8.4cm"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
