   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap">Figure 5.5 — A SoundFont&apos;s parameters: sends, envelope, filter, tuning and output.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___TocChoz2_2026"/>5.6 The sampler<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___TocChoz2_2026"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">choz plays folders of samples as instruments. <text:span text:style-name="T2">choz-sampler</text:span> is always in the source picker under <text:span text:style-name="T2">CLAP</text:span>; sample libraries found on the plugin paths (<text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">~/Samples</text:span> and <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">~/samples</text:span> by default, Preferences → Plugin paths) are listed under the <text:span text:style-name="T2">SAMPLE</text:span> chip. Picking the sampler puts it in the tab empty; <text:span text:style-name="T2">LOAD</text:span> asks for a folder, a <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.zip</text:span> or a single audio file (<text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.wav</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.flac</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.aiff</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.mp3</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">.ogg</text:span>).</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="fig_sampler.png" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="16cm" svg:height="3.764cm"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
