   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2455_3455341890"/>6.2 The chain<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2455_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">A tab holds up to twelve effects, in order. Each shows all of its knobs and, underneath, its slot row: ON/OFF, input and output level in dB, moving it along the chain, deleting it, and its preset buttons.</text:p>
