   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap">Figure 7.6 — The same plugin&apos;s presets, grouped by folder.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2467_3455341890"/>7.2 Scanning and paths<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2467_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Plugins are scanned in the background and cached, so the picker opens instantly on later starts. EDIT → Rescan plugin paths repeats the scan; <text:span text:style-name="T2">F5</text:span> in the picker does the same. Where choz looks is set in Settings (section 13.2).</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2469_3455341890"/>7.3 A plugin&apos;s own window<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2469_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">g</text:span> opens the instrument&apos;s window and <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">G</text:span> the selected effect&apos;s. choz embeds it in an X11 window of its own — LV2 <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">ui:X11UI</text:span>, VST2 <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">effEditOpen</text:span>, CLAP <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">clap.gui</text:span> on the host&apos;s timer, VST3 <text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">IPlugView</text:span> on the Linux event loop. LADSPA, DSSI and Pure Data have no embeddable window; their parameters are driven from the rack.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Imagen20" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="9.705cm" svg:height="13.067cm"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
