   <text:p text:style-name="Cuerpo_20_de_20_texto.cap">Figure 11.2 — The WAVE panel with a SoundFont&apos;s signal going through the internal reverb.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2513_3455341890"/>12. Projects<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc2513_3455341890"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="T2">F10</text:span> opens the menu bar. <text:span text:style-name="T2">FILE</text:span> makes, saves and opens projects; <text:span text:style-name="T2">EDIT</text:span> leads to Settings and to rescanning the plugin paths; <text:span text:style-name="T2">HELP</text:span> shows the About box.</text:p>
